{"id":"19.5.2","doc":"T","title":"Endianness","words":239,"blocks":[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":1,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Under the DMA-"},{"t":"block","v":"AES","id":"crypto"},{"t":"text","v":" working mode, the transmission of source data and result data for AES Accelerator is solely controlled by DMA."}]},{"n":2,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Therefore, the AES Accelerator cannot control the Endianness of the source data and result data, but does have requirement on how these data should be stored in memory and on the length of the data."}],"warn":true}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":3,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"For example, let us assume DMA needs to write the following data into memory at address 0x0280."}]}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":4,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Data represented in hexadecimal: 0102030405060708090A0B0C0D0E0F101112131415161718191A1B1C1D1E1F20"}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":5,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Data Length: Equals to 2 blocks."}]}]}]]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":6,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Then, this data will be stored in memory as shown in Table 19.5-4 below."}]}]},{"t":"table","caption":"Table 19.5-4. Text Endianness for DMA-AES","head":[[{"t":"text","v":"Address"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Byte"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Address"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Byte"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Address"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Byte"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Address"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Byte"}]],"rows":[{"n":7,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"0x0280"}],[{"t":"text","v":"0x01"}],[{"t":"text","v":"0x0281"}],[{"t":"text","v":"0x02"}],[{"t":"text","v":"0x0282"}],[{"t":"text","v":"0x03"}],[{"t":"text","v":"0x0283"}],[{"t":"text","v":"0x04"}]]},{"n":8,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"0x0284"}],[{"t":"text","v":"0x05"}],[{"t":"text","v":"0x0285"}],[{"t":"text","v":"0x06"}],[{"t":"text","v":"0x0286"}],[{"t":"text","v":"0x07"}],[{"t":"text","v":"0x0287"}],[{"t":"text","v":"0x08"}]]},{"n":9,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"0x0288"}],[{"t":"text","v":"0x09"}],[{"t":"text","v":"0x0289"}],[{"t":"text","v":"0x0A"}],[{"t":"text","v":"0x028A"}],[{"t